# Import preview — mobile native cards

At `max-width: 640px`, loan statement import previews use the same expandable-card approach as Search (keep table DOM; CSS grid cards). Spending statement uploads live on Reconcile, not Home.

## Loan (`#statement-import-results`)

- Toolbar select-all + “Tap a row to edit your share”
- Collapsed: include · desc · bank £ · chevron; dupe badge on second line
- Expanded: date + your-share input
- Desktop keeps wide table; badge/toggle columns `display: none`

## Tokens

Reuse Search mint/ink (`--ink`, `--muted`, `--line`, accent ring). Do not introduce a new palette.
